---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="AI Chat"
	description="Streaming LLM chat application template utilizing Server-Sent Events (SSE) and Workers AI."
>
	<p>
		<strong>AI Chat</strong> is a lightweight, responsive chat interface designed to run LLM conversations at the edge. Utilizing Server-Sent Events (SSE) to stream text responses from Cloudflare's model registry, it provides a performant chatbot workspace with minimal load-time overhead and client-side history preservation.
	</p>

	<h2>Technical Stack</h2>

	<div class="specs-grid">
		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Edge AI & Stream</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Inference Engine</td><td>Cloudflare Workers AI LLMs</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Models Supported</td><td><code>Llama-3-8B-Instruct</code>, <code>Mistral-7B</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Stream API</td><td>Server-Sent Events (SSE)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Language</td><td>TypeScript</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Infrastructure</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Compute</td><td>Cloudflare Workers</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">AI Telemetry</td><td>Cloudflare AI Gateway (Rate limiting & logging)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Session Cache</td><td>Client-side browser state (sessionStorage/localStorage)</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Streaming with SSE:</strong> Instead of waiting for full LLM completions, the edge Worker streams individual tokens to the client as they are generated, improving perceived response times.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Core Features</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Responsive Chat Interface</strong> — Clean, mobile-friendly layout optimized for typing, reading, and viewing code blocks.</li>
		<li><strong>AI Gateway Integration</strong> — Configured to run through Cloudflare AI Gateway to enable caching, logging, analytics, and custom rate limits.</li>
		<li><strong>Local History Persistence</strong> — Stores conversation history directly on the user's browser, preventing server leaks and maintaining chat continuity across reloads.</li>
		<li><strong>Custom Prompts</strong> — Easily supports overriding the LLM's system prompt or selecting different model categories directly from the web layout.</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="tech-tags">
		<span class="tag">Cloudflare Workers</span>
		<span class="tag">Workers AI</span>
		<span class="tag">AI Gateway</span>
		<span class="tag">Server-Sent Events</span>
		<span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
		<span class="tag">LLM Streaming</span>
	</div>

	<div class="back-link-wrapper">
		<a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.specs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.spec-card {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(30, 35, 50, 0.5);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.spec-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.spec-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.spec-icon {
		color: var(--accent);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.spec-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.spec-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.spec-table td {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.spec-table tr:last-child td {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.spec-label {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-weight: 600;
		width: 5rem;
	}

	.lab-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.lab-note svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
	}

	.tech-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.tag {
		padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.back-link-wrapper {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.3);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.specs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
